{"meta":{"id":"db-storage-benchmark","category":"it/server/backend/database","title":"시계열 저장소 성능 비교","subtitle":"","summary":"5,008만 행 일별 시세로 PostgreSQL · Parquet+DuckDB · MongoDB(일반/TS) 비교 — 단건 조회는 PG, 집계 · 이동평균은 DuckDB(PG 대비 12~15배), 용량은 MongoDB TS","tags":["postgresql","mongodb","duckdb","parquet","db","성능","docker"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"db-benchmark","updatedAt":"2026-10-20"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>BENCHMARK</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-20</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">시계열 저장소 성능 비교</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 5,008만 행 일별 시세로 PostgreSQL · Parquet+DuckDB · MongoDB(일반/TS) 비교 — 단건 조회는 PG, 집계 · 이동평균은 DuckDB(PG 대비 12~15배), 용량은 MongoDB TS</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">한눈에 보기</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">주식 일별 시세(종목 × 날짜) 데이터를 <strong class='text-stone-900'>PostgreSQL, Parquet + DuckDB, MongoDB(일반 / Time Series)</strong> 에 넣고 같은 질의 6개를 비교했습니다. 실데이터 152만 행으로 먼저 재고, 더미 5,008만 행으로 다시 잰 뒤, 다른 앱을 끈 재측정과 순서를 뒤집은 역순 측정까지 해서 순위가 바뀌지 않는 것을 확인했습니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">질의 유형</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">1위</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">차이</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">단건 조회</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PostgreSQL</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.4~5 ms (인덱스)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">풀스캔 집계</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Parquet + DuckDB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PG 보다 1.8~2.6배</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">이동평균(윈도)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Parquet + DuckDB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PG 보다 <strong class='text-stone-900'>12~15배</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">조건 검색</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MongoDB TS ≈ PG</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.64초 / 0.69초</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">용량</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MongoDB TS</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PG 의 1/9 (Parquet 통합 1/7)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">환경</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">PC</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Windows 11, 논리 코어 24개, RAM 31 GB</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">PostgreSQL</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Docker <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>postgres:17</code> (WSL2), <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>shared_buffers=1GB</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>work_mem=64MB</code>, 병렬 워커 4개. PK(종목코드, 날짜) + 인덱스(날짜), 인덱스(업종명)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">MongoDB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Docker <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>mongo:8.0</code>, WiredTiger 캐시 2 GB. 일반 컬렉션(인덱스는 PG 와 같게) + Time Series 컬렉션(metaField=종목 정보, 버킷 1년)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Parquet</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">DuckDB 1.5.6 / pyarrow, Python 3.13. 레이아웃 3가지 — 날짜별 파일, 종목별 파일, (종목코드, 날짜) 정렬 통합 파일(zstd, row group 5만 행)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">측정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">쿼리 실행 ~ 파이썬이 결과를 다 받을 때까지 wall time. 첫 1회(cold)를 빼고 반복한 <strong class='text-stone-900'>warm 중앙값</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">데이터와 질의</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">데이터</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">행 수</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">실데이터</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,519,091행</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">코스피 381 + 코스닥 1,736종목, 약 3년</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">더미</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">50,080,000행</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2만 종목 × 10년(2,504거래일). t 분포 수익률 랜덤워크, 호가 단위 반올림, 업종 분포는 실데이터 비율, 시드 고정</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">질의</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">성격</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">종목 하나 전체 시계열</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">포인트 조회 (종목 키)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">종목 하나 최근 60거래일</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">포인트 조회 + LIMIT</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">하루치 전 종목</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">포인트 조회 (날짜 키)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">업종 × 월 집계</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">풀스캔 GROUP BY</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">급등 이벤트 필터 (등락률 ≥ 15, 거래대금 ≥ 100억)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">풀스캔 필터</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">종목별 20일 이동평균</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">윈도 함수 (정렬 + 파티션)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Q6 는 모든 엔진에서 같은 계산을 하도록 아래처럼 결과 값을 쓰게 했습니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 종가가 20일 이동평균보다 높은 행 수 (결과를 실제로 써야 PG 가 계산을 건너뛰지 않는다)\r\nSELECT count(*) FILTER (WHERE 종가 &gt; ma20)\r\nFROM (\r\n    SELECT 종가,\r\n           avg(종가) OVER (PARTITION BY 종목코드 ORDER BY 날짜 ROWS 19 PRECEDING) AS ma20\r\n    FROM daily_price\r\n) t;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">결과 — 더미 5,008만 행 (warm 중앙값, ms)</h2><span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">정순 + 역순</span></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">질의</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">PG</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">Mongo 일반</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">Mongo TS</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB 날짜별</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB 종목별</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB 통합</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q1 종목 10년</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>4.7~5.1</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">12~14</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">15~19</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3,072~3,356</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">14~16</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">104~117</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q2 종목 60일</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>0.4~0.5</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.7~0.9</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.9~1.6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,899~2,034</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">12</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">92~94</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q3 하루치</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">51~56</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">480~1,232</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2,652~2,721</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>40~43</strong> (파일 직접)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">⚠ 159,339~162,629</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q4 업종×월 집계</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2,690~4,290</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">37,300~39,129</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">19,340~19,972</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,924~2,240</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>1,485~1,675</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q5 급등 필터</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">688~693</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">19,154~19,745</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>636~652</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2,379~2,596</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,028~1,440</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q6 MA20 윈도</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">71,358~73,242</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">98,389~113,326 *</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">142,728~151,679 *</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>5,949~6,235</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>4,854~9,071</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">정순 · 역순 두 번 측정한 값의 범위입니다. 굵은 글씨가 질의별 1위, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>*</code> 는 첫 실행이 60초를 넘어 1회만 잰 값입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">결과 — 실데이터 152만 행 (warm 중앙값, ms)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">질의</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">PG</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB 날짜별</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB 종목별</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB 통합</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q1 종목 3년</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>2.0</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">572</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">5.0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">23.9</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q2 종목 60일</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>0.5</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">516</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2.4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">11.6</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q3 하루치</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>3.7</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">7.7 (직접) / 250 (glob)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">184</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q4 업종×월 집계</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">114</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">541</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>95</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q5 급등 필터</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>38</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">563</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">55</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q6 MA20 윈도</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3,075</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">703</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">–</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>380</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">데이터가 전부 메모리에 들어가는 크기라 디스크 차이는 거의 드러나지 않았습니다. 그래도 Q6 윈도 함수는 이미 PG 가 약 8배 느렸습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">규모가 33배 커지면</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">질의</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">PG</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB 통합</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">해석</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q1 종목 시계열</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2.0 → 6.1 ms</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">24 → 122 ms</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">B-tree 인덱스라 PG 는 거의 그대로</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q4 풀스캔 집계</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">114 → 4,416 ms (39배)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">95 → 1,991 ms (21배)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PG 는 메모리를 넘기면서 행 수보다 가파르게 느려짐</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Q6 윈도</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3,075 → 85,424 ms (28배)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">380 → 14,249 ms</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">어느 규모에서도 PG 가 약 8배 이상 느림</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">저장 용량 · 적재 시간 (5,008만 행)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">저장 방식</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용량</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">PG 대비</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">적재</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">PostgreSQL</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">8.4 + 인덱스 2.1 = <strong class='text-stone-900'>10.6 GB</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">COPY 266초 + 인덱스 108초</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">MongoDB 일반</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">4.3 + 인덱스 1.7 = 6.1 GB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.58</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">insert 137초 + 인덱스 193초</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">MongoDB Time Series</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>1.2 GB</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.11</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">insert 173초 + 인덱스 1초</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Parquet 날짜별 (5,008개)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2.4 GB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.22</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">161초</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Parquet 종목별 (20,000개)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.8 GB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.17</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">통합과 함께 177초</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Parquet 통합 (20개)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.5 GB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.14</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">MongoDB 일반 컬렉션은 비압축 17.6 GB 를 기본 압축(snappy)으로 4.3 GB 까지 줄였습니다. Time Series 는 종목 × 연도 버킷 단위로 모아 저장해 가장 작습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">용도별 선택</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">추천</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">근거</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">단건 조회 (종목 · 사용자 하나)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PostgreSQL</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0.4~5 ms. MongoDB 도 0.7~19 ms 라 실사용 차이 없음</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">하루치 · 특정 날짜 전체</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PostgreSQL, 날짜 파일 직접 읽기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PG 51~56 ms, 날짜 parquet 40 ms. MongoDB 는 0.5~2.7초로 불리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">조건 검색</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MongoDB TS, PostgreSQL</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">TS 버킷의 필드별 최소·최대값으로 버킷을 건너뜀(추정) — 0.64초</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">풀스캔 집계 · 이동평균 같은 특징 계산</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Parquet + DuckDB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">집계 1.8~2.6배, 윈도 12~15배 PG 보다 빠름. MongoDB 보다 16~23배</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">오래 쌓아 두는 보관</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MongoDB TS, Parquet 통합</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">PG 대비 1/9 ~ 1/7 용량</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">피할 것</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MongoDB 일반 컬렉션으로 대량 분석</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Q4 37초 · Q5 19초 · Q6 98초 이상으로 분석 쿼리 전부 최하위</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">정리하면 <strong class='text-stone-900'>원본은 PG 또는 MongoDB TS 에 쌓아 단건 조회를 맡기고, 집계 · 특징 계산은 Parquet 으로 내보내 DuckDB 로 하는 구성</strong>이 이번 측정 기준으로 가장 효율적입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">측정하면서 배운 것</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">주제</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">파일 레이아웃 > 엔진</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">같은 parquet 라도 날짜별 파일로 종목을 찾으면 2~4초, 종목별 파일이면 12 ms. 느린 이유가 PG/parquet 가 아니라 <strong class='text-stone-900'>조회 키와 파일 분할이 맞는지</strong>였다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">정렬 순서</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">(종목, 날짜) 정렬 통합 파일에서 날짜로 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>SELECT *</code> 하면 모든 row group 을 풀어야 해 2분 이상 걸렸다(컬럼 하나면 0.87초, 스레드를 늘릴수록 더 느려짐). 주력 조회 키로 정렬하고, 둘 다 필요하면 날짜별 · 종목별 두 벌을 둔다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">작은 파일 수천 개</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파일 5,008개를 한꺼번에 여는 쿼리에서 Windows '시스템 리소스 부족' 오류로 측정이 두 번 중단됐다. 느린 것만이 아니라 실패할 수 있으니 운영에서는 파일을 병합한다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">cold 값은 인용하지 않기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">첫 실행 값은 앞에서 무엇을 읽었는지에 따라 10배 이상 달라졌다(PG Q3 1,227 → 97 ms). 순서를 뒤집어 재측정해도 warm 값은 대부분 ±20% 안이라 비교에는 warm 중앙값을 쓴다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">메모리 경쟁</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">다른 앱이 켜진 상태에서 PG Q4 가 14.8초 → 다른 앱을 끄니 4.3초 → 메모리 여유 11 GB 에서 2.7초. DuckDB 연결을 재사용하면 기본 memory_limit(RAM 80%)가 Docker VM 과 다퉈 수치가 부풀어서 쿼리마다 새 연결 + 8 GB 제한으로 바꿨다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">결과를 쓰는 쿼리로 재기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Q6 를 처음엔 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>count(*)</code> 만 반환하게 짰더니 PG 가 윈도 계산을 통째로 건너뛰었다(37 ms). 결과 값을 쓰도록 바꾸고 모든 엔진의 결과 행 수(25,576,624)가 같은지 확인했다</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">한계</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• 클라이언트 1개, 읽기만 측정 — 동시 접속과 쓰기 부하는 다루지 않았다.<br>• PG 응답 시간에 Windows Docker(WSL2) 네트워크 오버헤드가 들어 있다. 진짜 디스크 cold 성능은 재지 않았다.<br>• MongoDB 캐시를 2 GB 로 제한했고 기본 설정 그대로다(미리 집계한 컬렉션 · 샤딩 같은 최적화 없음).<br>• 더미 반복은 3회(60초 넘는 MongoDB 쿼리는 1회)라 중앙값 신뢰도가 높지 않다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">관련 문서</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">PG 쿼리 자체를 고친 방식은 같은 폴더의 <strong>PostgreSQL 쿼리 개선</strong>, JSON · Parquet 형식 설명은 <strong>aide › 튜토리얼</strong> 에 있습니다.</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/backend/database/db-storage-benchmark","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"backend","title":"백엔드","path":"it/server/backend"},{"id":"database","title":"DB · 쿼리","path":"it/server/backend/database"}],"hasImage":false}